<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:40:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>塔塔钢铁公司在强烈反对后考虑改变 APL Apollo 交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/tata-steel-weighs-changes-to-apl-apollo-deal-after-backlash</link><description>塔塔钢铁有限公司首席执行官 TV Narendran 向 CNBC-TV18 表示，塔塔钢铁有限公司正在考虑修改其收购 APL Apollo Tubes Ltd. 的计划，以安抚对交易结构感到担忧的投资者。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/tata-steel-weighs-changes-to-apl-apollo-deal-after-backlash'&gt;塔塔钢铁公司在强烈反对后考虑改变 APL Apollo 交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Tata Steel Weighs Changes to APL Apollo Deal After Backlash&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/tata-steel-weighs-changes-to-apl-apollo-deal-after-backlash</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:08:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>高盛策略师表示，现在买入人工智能抛售还为时过早</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/goldman-strategist-says-it-s-too-early-to-buy-the-ai-selloff</link><description>高盛集团 (Goldman Sachs Group Inc.) 的克里斯蒂安·穆勒-格利斯曼 (Christian Mueller-Glissmann) 表示，投资者需要从用于构建人工智能的数十亿美元中看到真正的利润，他警告说现在购买股票还为时过早。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/goldman-strategist-says-it-s-too-early-to-buy-the-ai-selloff'&gt;高盛策略师表示，现在买入人工智能抛售还为时过早&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Goldman Strategist Says It’s Too Early to Buy the AI Selloff&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/goldman-strategist-says-it-s-too-early-to-buy-the-ai-selloff</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:17:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于投资者担心人工智能建设的巨额投资的回报，美国科技股预计将连续第二天下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Stock Futures Plunge as Renewed AI Worries Fuels Tech Losses&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于数据中心的繁荣导致供应紧张，美国钢铁买家转向海外</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-steel-buyers-turn-abroad-as-data-center-boom-strains-supply</link><description>尽管华盛顿征收关税，但由于数据中心建设热潮挤压了国内供应并推高了价格，较便宜的亚洲进口产品正在吸引美国钢铁买家。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-steel-buyers-turn-abroad-as-data-center-boom-strains-supply'&gt;由于数据中心的繁荣导致供应紧张，美国钢铁买家转向海外&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Steel Buyers Turn Abroad as Data Center Boom Strains Supply&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-steel-buyers-turn-abroad-as-data-center-boom-strains-supply</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:12:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>欧洲天然气交易商将迎来动荡的冬天</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/europe-s-gas-traders-are-in-for-a-volatile-winter</link><description>非洲大陆微薄的供应缓冲，加上不断变化的天气预报和中东战争，将继续冲击市场。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/europe-s-gas-traders-are-in-for-a-volatile-winter'&gt;欧洲天然气交易商将迎来动荡的冬天&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Europe’s Gas Traders Are in for a Volatile Winter&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/europe-s-gas-traders-are-in-for-a-volatile-winter</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:24:16 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>